  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "A feature release, fully backward compatible with 1.0.0. An InfoBar can now close itself after a period you choose, through the new DisplayDuration property or the IInfoBarService.ShowAsync(TimeSpan, …) extension overload, and still never does unless you ask. A ContentDialog can now sit on a darker secondary background with Classes=\"secondary\", backed by the new EnigmaDialogSecondaryBackground colour and brush keys, and its card now paints the control's Background. No runtime dependency changes. See RELEASENOTES.md for the full details.",
